experience = '''<div class="experience-list"><article><div><span>OCT 2025 — PRESENT</span><p>Progressive Edge Inc</p></div><div><h3>Project Manager / Programmer</h3><p>Building enterprise tools from the application to the data layer. Developed a .NET MAUI Android application connecting barcode scanning, inventory lookup, and label printing with a SQL Server ERP through custom REST middleware.</p><div class="tags"><span>C# / .NET MAUI</span><span>API development</span><span>Client collaboration</span></div></div></article><article><div><span>APR 2024 — SEP 2025</span><p>Benda CPR Services · Contract</p></div><div><h3>Web Developer</h3><p>Created custom web pages and plugins, tested and resolved website issues, and supported marketing initiatives. Combined technical delivery with a focus on the customer experience.</p></div></article><article><div><span>OCT 2024 — FEB 2025</span><p>Sussex Tool and Supply</p></div><div><h3>Web Developer</h3><p>Developed RESTful APIs, extended NopCommerce with custom .NET Core plugins, and optimized SQL operations supporting e-commerce transactions.</p></div></article><article><div><span>MAR 2023 — JUN 2024</span><p>Community Care Inc</p></div><div><h3>Software Developer</h3><p>Contributed to modular healthcare applications with ASP.NET Core MVC and Razor Pages. Built responsive interfaces with JavaScript and jQuery, participated in code reviews and automated testing, and provided SQL-based technical support.</p></div></article><article><div><span>AUG 2020 — NOV 2022</span><p>Oklahoma Baptist University</p></div><div><h3>Help Desk Assistant</h3><p>Supported people and their technology through troubleshooting, device imaging, Active Directory management, and clear issue documentation.</p></div></article></div>'''

